OL,3,GNEWSAA38 reopens after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road in Derbyshire which was
OL,7,Fpartially shut following a
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash has been fully
OL,9,Freopened.
OL,11,FNational Highways said on Saturday the
OL,12,Fnorthbound carriageway of the A38 was
OL,13,Fclosed between its junctions with the
OL,14,FA50 and the A516.
OL,16,FDerbyshire Police and East Midlands
OL,17,FAmbulance Service attended, and drivers
OL,18,Fwere warned of congestion.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
