OL,3,GNEWSAA38 reopens after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on social media, National
OL,7,FHighways said the road reopened and
OL,8,Fnormal traffic resumed at about 15:50
OL,9,FBST.
